+      <label>How the monitors show a stereoscopic 3D video: 0 Enable 3D off, the left eye's view, flat, nothing declared, 1 the left eye's view only, 2 in 3D, the monitor itself the 3D area, where the compositor takes stereo content. The clip monitor has its own, stereo3d_clip_preview.</label>
       <default>2</default>
     </entry>
 
     <entry name="stereo3d_clip_preview" type="Int">
-      <label>How the clip monitor shows a stereoscopic 3D video: 0 the packed frame as it is, 1 the left eye's view only, 2 in 3D, the monitor itself the 3D area, where the compositor takes stereo content.</label>
+      <label>How the clip monitor shows a stereoscopic 3D video: 0 Enable 3D off, the left eye's view, flat, nothing declared, 1 the left eye's view only, 2 in 3D, the monitor itself the 3D area, where the compositor takes stereo content.</label>
